 "requirement": "Complete-task time at N sessions at most 2.0x the original serial control of that backend, cold and warm, p50 and p95 -- at least half the speed of no concurrency at all. The earlier startup-2x and fixed-work-1.10x gates are not applied. Every validity check is unchanged: all items passing, artifacts verified, execution proof, turn-two marker recall, exactly one result, no cleanup survivors.",
